  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a9afe18ef33d08b40b13fe93a85d4b05, type: 3}
  m_Name: AveryR1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  conversationName: 
  lines:
  - text: Hehe... That's just how he is, I suppose. He doesn't mean much by it.
    expressionKey: shp_normal
  - text: I'd be irritable too if some intergalactic federation has a kill-on-sight
      order for humans.
    expressionKey: shp_normal
  - text: When I found him, flying solo, I found him floating in space!
    expressionKey: shp_normal
  - text: Can you believe that Mamaris can hibernate for long periods of time in
      space and be totally fine? It's incredible. They can even breathe from their
      side vents!
    expressionKey: shp_normal
  - text: Anyways, so yeah, so he had 3 of his limbs chopped off for doing some grand
      sin against Mamarian society or something, I dunno, he doesn't like to talk
      much about it.
    expressionKey: shp_normal
  - text: Since then, I've took him under my wing, taught him how everything works,
      the Federation, the universal language, et cetera. Turns out, he really has
      a knack for fiddling and inventing stuff.
    expressionKey: shp_normal
  - text: So I guess that's why the I.F. decided to keep him, and plus having a non-hostile
      Mamari to experiment with...
    expressionKey: shp_normal
  - text: ...It's despicable. But it's better than...
    expressionKey: shp_normal
  - text: Let's talk about something else.
    expressionKey: shp_normal
  nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
  hasButtons: 0
  buttons: []
